WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.620
P-Please, stop.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.620
If you want money... Here.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.200
Are you trying to insult us?

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:27.120
Listen, we're not in this for the money.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:30.540
Th-Then why do you always...

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:34.420
Are you stupid? We're friends, right?

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:37.680
Right?

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.720
We're always just playing.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.890
How is life here for you?

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:22.800
Have you adjusted?

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.600
Yes.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:28.940
I've heard you're dedicated to meditating.
Did you see something?

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:30.900
No.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:36.690
You're always so quiet.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.570
Well, it's fine.
I have a present for you today.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.380
How does it feel?

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.880
The size is perfect, but...

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.670
The elbow moves, but not the fingers.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.630
It suits you, Gai.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:07.520
You have no words of thanks?
You never have said thank you, have you?

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.020
Even when we saved you.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.780
First, you should thank Master Kigetsu
of the Hagakure Shrine.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.080
If I hadn't been following you
at his request,

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.910
by now you'd be...

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.620
Kazumo, was it?

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.790
I never asked you to save me.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:40.010
Bastard. Is that how you speak
to the man who saved your life?

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.220
It's fine, Kazumo.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.720
You're being a little petty.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.560
P-Petty?

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:52.600
Gai, we Gabi have been fighting
the Busoma secretly for ages.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:58.360
But you're the first to become a Busoma
and then cut off your weapon.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:03.360
But I can see that the demon within you
has yet to disappear.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.870
I don't know what
you're thinking right now.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:11.580
But never try to kill yourself again.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.330
Even if your body is destroyed,
your soul will not be saved.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.800
If you wish for fulfillment,
then live as if you're dead.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.670
Then the demon within you will disappear.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:24.800
Live... as if dead?

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:30.350
Lady Himiko, Master Kazumo.
Preparations for the match are complete.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.520
Would you like to watch, Gai?

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.610
Come see the Hollow Kempo
that we Gabi use.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.120
Begin!

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.210
Tie! Resume!

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.050
Tie! Resume!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.220
A strange form of martial arts...
Is this a match?

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.680
Why do they keep tying?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:13.560
Tying is the path to
Hollow Kempo's greatest techniques.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.980
But they're not truly even.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.270
There's an attacker and a defender,

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:22.070
and the defender is reading
the attacker's movements.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:25.490
Hollow Kempo is
to become one with your opponent.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.950
And for that,
you must reach a state of emptiness.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:31.030
Is that even possible?

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.870
She's right there.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:38.830
Himiko is the second person
in the 300 year history of the Gabi

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.170
to master the techniques.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.550
When she was nine, her father,
the previous leader of the clan,

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:49.970
recognized she became enlightened,

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:53.180
and gave her the jewels
that signify leadership in the clan.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.430
Himiko attained a state of emptiness.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.350
And became a holy being.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:03.280
Well? Want to play a little?

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:05.490
Thank you, ma'am.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.500
What's wrong? The sun will set.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:30.220
And now there are 21 different
cursed weapons within her.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:34.510
All of them were taken
from the Busoma she defeated.

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.560
Twenty one weapons?

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.190
Impossible. If you did that...

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:44.270
Normally you'd become a Crysalis,
or a Busoma.

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.440
Or perhaps the power
of the weapon would simply kill you.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.360
But to Himiko, it's nothing.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.370
She is a sheathe for all weapons.

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:57.290
And for a person to be a sheathe,
they must be hollow.

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.870
Just like how a sheathe is empty.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.000
A sheathe...

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.590
Sorry. I drained some of your energy.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:17.100
The way you fight is a bit too energetic.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.270
You can have it back.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.690
Well, Gai?

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:29.320
Are you willing
to try the next type of training?

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.530
You want me to learn Hollow Kempo?

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.780
No, you don't need Kempo.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:37.410
Your opponent is yourself.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.080
Kuromaru, go play
with your friends for once.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.630
Hey, be my friend.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.550
Let me inside you.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.640
Beyond that door...

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.860
This is the Hall of Hellfire.

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:12.530
It will test your karma.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.990
What are we doing?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:18.870
It's simple.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.370
You must simply leave the circle created
by those candles.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:24.870
That's all?

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:36.090
These flames react to your karma.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:40.810
The darker your karma,
the brighter they burn.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.160
<i>Kill!</i>

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.120
<i>Kill!</i>

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:58.780
<i>Kill!</i>

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.490
<i>Kill!</i>

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.290
Th-This is...

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:45.460
I drained his energy to quell the flames.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.750
Did I go too far?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:50.000
No, but we have other problems.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:56.590
You must have also noticed
those evil flames...

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:02.220
If we let him stay here,
disaster is sure to come.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.890
Please, allow me--

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.680
Silence, Kazumo.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:10.860
What have we Gabi been fighting for?

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.490
Defeating the Busoma
means saving the people.

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:20.700
People with heavy burdens like Gai
are precisely the ones we must save.

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:23.490
This is not simply a place for training.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.750
It is a holy place,
where we offer salvation.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:31.790
Stop it.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.210
-Stop it!
-No way!

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.970
What are you talking about?
We're friends, right?

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:39.180
Come on, let's play some more!

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:42.350
No...

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.680
No more!

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.020
That bastard. Get him!

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:57.990
Please... I can't take anymore!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:03.200
Save me! Let me...
Let me inside you!

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:16.880
Kuromaru, there's no sense in hiding!

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.090
Come out!

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.340
Kuromaru!

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.180
Stop hiding--

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:41.360
Who're you?

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.280
My name is Grimms.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.990
And you will serve me!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.670
You surprised me yesterday.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.510
I thought the shrine would burn down.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.760
Many have trained with the hellfire,

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:06.970
but you're the first
to create such flames.

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:11.810
Don't you think it's time you told me?

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.770
Gai, why did you try to die?

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:23.780
Because I chose to hate myself
instead of hating the world.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:25.740
What do you mean?

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:29.910
The first voice I ever heard
was the Shiryu's...

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.580
when I was still in my mother's womb.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.210
"Kill, kill," it said.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:39.420
And my mother gave birth to me
and took her own life.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:46.390
When I reached out for my mother,
I found the Shiryu instead.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:51.310
The Shiryu and I are connected
by bonds of fate.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.060
I chose death
in order to cut those bounds.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:57.150
I see.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.570
But nothing changed.

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:04.490
The flames I saw yesterday
were my inner desire to kill.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.490
I haven't changed.

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.660
I don't want to fight anymore.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.620
I don't want to take anyone's life.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.710
If that's what you believe,
it means you have changed, right?

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.170
If nothing else,
you're trying to change, right?

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.840
Kazumo told me that you were hollow.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:31.220
Is that what it means
to live as if you're dead?

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.810
Can I be that way too?

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:36.480
Hollow?

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:43.530
I don't know.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.360
It's a sad thing,
living as if you're dead.

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:51.330
Many weapons sleep within me.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.330
One might say
that I'm a grave for weapons.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.000
Look. This is the energy
that I took from you yesterday.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:07.300
If you can tame that raging energy,
you'll be able to do things like this.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:19.600
What do you think.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.810
Flowers suit a grave.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:28.820
No... You're not a grave.

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:33.030
When you passed
through my body yesterday,

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:34.950
I felt you.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.660
I felt the warmth of your heartbeat.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.380
So...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.670
You're not a grave.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.310
Please wait, Lady Himiko.

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:04.980
What is it?

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:09.240
The reason you can safely keep
so many weapons within you

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:14.030
is that you are hollow,
with no love or hate.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.830
Have you forgotten your father's words?

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.830
Love is the most dangerous emotion.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.830
You must not abandon
your hollowness for love.

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:28.460
I know that.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.340
What are you worried about, Kazumo?

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:36.850
Is it Gai?
You think I'll fall in love with Gai?

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.520
I have faith in you, Lady Himiko.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.310
Then it's fine.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:45.480
Don't worry. You're a strange man.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.650
Kazumo.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:56.080
Do you really believe I'm hollow?

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.580
A holy being
who's achieved enlightenment?

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.710
Yes. Why do you ask?

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:08.590
True, my father said the same thing.
But I don't really know.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.840
Do you doubt yourself?

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.720
No, but if I were to have a secret...

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:20.850
It's that I'm nothing but a child.

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.110
Are you a Busoma?

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:33.950
Y-You mean me?

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.820
That's right, fatso.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:39.910
If you're a Busoma,
then I can get serious, right?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.330
Play with me, kiddo!

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.210
Come on!

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:47.880
<i>Help me!</i>

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.920
<i>Help me!</i>

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.230
Come on, run! Run!

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:09.650
Oh no, you've got nowhere to run.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:12.030
Stop!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.040
Who are you?

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:39.680
Oh, so fancy!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:52.320
I knew you'd appear, Geschoss.
The Mad Busoma.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.320
A demon who seeks only to fight.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.700
You two won't fight?

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:03.200
I'm only interested in a one-on-one fight.
I'll fight the winner.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.500
Eventually humanity will die,

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:10.210
and all that will be left is the Busoma
and their struggle for supremacy.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:14.300
But for that to happen,
the Busoshin must first manifest.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:15.720
The Busoshin?

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:19.720
The Busoshin is the path
to humanity's destruction.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.970
It is humanity's fate.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.810
<i>I don't know what
<i>the Busoshin's identity really is.</i></i>

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.860
<i>But is Grimms prophecy true?</i>

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.440
<i>Humans have a strange power.</i>

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.740
You're fun, mister!

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:46.910
No... I don't want to get hurt.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.500
<i>Listen, Busoma.</i>

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.210
<i>Follow the firebird.</i>

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:54.960
Seek me out.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.710
What do you want?

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:36.000
Gai Ogata, fight me.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:40.220
What do you mean? Why would we fight?

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:46.850
I once believed that saving someone
like you was the Gabi's duty.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:52.230
But I know that you will bring disaster
to Lady Himiko and the Gabi.

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.150
So you want to kill me?

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.610
And after saving me?
You change your mind quick.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:04.660
Are you scared? Then leave now.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:06.990
And never show your face here again.

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:11.120
I refuse. I still have much to learn here.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:12.670
In that case...

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:19.340
Fight! You can't fight me unarmed.

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:20.590
Take the sword.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:24.800
I refuse that too. I'll never fight again.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.720
I'll never hurt anyone.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:27.970
Don't insult me!

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.810
You can't even lay a finger on me!

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.190
No bullying... No...

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:42.190
A Busoma!

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:43.820
Stop!

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:54.670
What's this?
